        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/dde484979385d5dd05dedf1bfc324089.poster.avif?t=1788997943\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/dde484979385d5dd05dedf1bfc324089.webm?t=1788997943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/dde484979385d5dd05dedf1bfc324089.mp4?t=1788997943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2v2 Fighting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hectic battle system of <strong>four players on the screen</strong> with <strong>classic motion controls</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/e286acb907c01288135df64b7370ab1a.poster.avif?t=1788997943\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/e286acb907c01288135df64b7370ab1a.webm?t=1788997943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/e286acb907c01288135df64b7370ab1a.mp4?t=1788997943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Battle System Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supers, parries, red parries,  teleports, roll canceling, pushblock, perfect just-frame electric uppercuts, fast fly, crossups, stances, invincibility frames, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/1048e1244a4075ede0e96ac15e430b43.poster.avif?t=1788997943\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/1048e1244a4075ede0e96ac15e430b43.webm?t=1788997943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/1048e1244a4075ede0e96ac15e430b43.mp4?t=1788997943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gem System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Gem to change the tides of battle. Each team gets a Gem meter allowing for powerful attacks called Gem Singulars and the Gem Cosmo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/78f538fa317dcaae533a42c27ef038b8.poster.avif?t=1788997943\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/78f538fa317dcaae533a42c27ef038b8.webm?t=1788997943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/78f538fa317dcaae533a42c27ef038b8.mp4?t=1788997943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combo Trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn 20 combos for each character. <strong>Warning</strong>: the last trials are very difficult!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/2e0e04da25397f88c933b865e833e9ff.poster.avif?t=1788997943\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/2e0e04da25397f88c933b865e833e9ff.webm?t=1788997943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\