 the full launch)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras/7707e011e4118be958467145754bd86e.avif?t=1788997943\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212400/extras_big/7707e011e4118be958467145754bd86e.webp?t=1788997943 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other Features </strong>— 1v1, 1v2, Versus, Training, Button Configuration. (Note: Arcade mode and mini-games are currently planned for the future)</p>",
